{"sequence":13,"at":"2026-09-30T21:15:52.904Z","kind":"dispatch","attemptId":"provider-attempt-7","phase":"initial","transport":"schema-tool","attempt":{"id":"provider-attempt-7","phase":"initial","transport":"schema-tool","status":"pending","startedAt":"2026-09-30T21:15:52.904Z","request":{"messageCount":11,"messageCharacters":42020,"toolNames":["source_list","source_search","source_symbol","source_read","skill_reference_read"],"maxTokens":6000,"executableTools":true,"toolSchemas":[{"type":"object","properties":{"offset":{"type":"integer","minimum":0},"limit":{"type":"integer","minimum":1}},"required":[],"additionalProperties":false},{"type":"object","properties":{"text":{"type":"string"},"path":{"type":"string"},"limit":{"type":"integer","minimum":1}},"required":["text"],"additionalProperties":false},{"type":"object","properties":{"name":{"type":"string"},"path":{"type":"string"}},"required":["name"],"additionalProperties":false},{"type":"object","properties":{"path":{"type":"string"},"startLine":{"type":"integer","minimum":1},"endLine":{"type":"integer","minimum":1}},"required":["path","startLine","endLine"],"additionalProperties":false},{"type":"object","properties":{"path":{"type":"string"}},"required":["path"],"additionalProperties":false}]},"usage":null,"costUsd":null,"transportAttempts":"unknown"}}
{"sequence":14,"at":"2026-09-30T21:16:19.359Z","kind":"response","attemptId":"provider-attempt-7","phase":"initial","transport":"schema-tool","attempt":{"id":"provider-attempt-7","phase":"initial","transport":"schema-tool","status":"response","startedAt":"2026-09-30T21:15:52.904Z","request":{"messageCount":11,"messageCharacters":42020,"toolNames":["source_list","source_search","source_symbol","source_read","skill_reference_read"],"maxTokens":6000,"executableTools":true,"toolSchemas":[{"type":"object","properties":{"offset":{"type":"integer","minimum":0},"limit":{"type":"integer","minimum":1}},"required":[],"additionalProperties":false},{"type":"object","properties":{"text":{"type":"string"},"path":{"type":"string"},"limit":{"type":"integer","minimum":1}},"required":["text"],"additionalProperties":false},{"type":"object","properties":{"name":{"type":"string"},"path":{"type":"string"}},"required":["name"],"additionalProperties":false},{"type":"object","properties":{"path":{"type":"string"},"startLine":{"type":"integer","minimum":1},"endLine":{"type":"integer","minimum":1}},"required":["path","startLine","endLine"],"additionalProperties":false},{"type":"object","properties":{"path":{"type":"string"}},"required":["path"],"additionalProperties":false}]},"usage":{"input":8854,"output":1190,"cacheRead":12416,"cacheWrite":0},"costUsd":null,"transportAttempts":"unknown","response":{"text":"## Findings summary\n\n| Result | Critical | High | Medium | Low | Info |\n|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|\n| **Conforms to supplied policy** | 0 | 0 | 0 | 0 | 1 |\n\n**Conclusion:** No—an ordinary `USER` space member cannot remove a different member through `DeleteSpaceMember`. Self-removal is explicitly allowed and follows a different authorization branch. **Confidence: High.**\n\n## Actual source-visible behavior\n\n1. The caller must be authenticated. `requireCurrentSpaceUser` rejects a missing current user as `Unauthenticated`.【ev-3d734d20f7f464a28010】\n\n2. The requested space and target membership are resolved before deletion:\n   - the caller must have an active membership in that space;\n   - the target must be a normal user with an active membership;\n   - otherwise the operation returns an error, generally `NotFound`.【ev-3d734d20f7f464a28010】【ev-6e0386d52f2d18b6913e】\n\n3. The controlling authorization branch is:\n\n   ```go\n   isSelf := targetUser.ID == currentUser.ID\n   if !isSelf {\n       if err := requireSpaceAdministrator(callerMembership); err != nil {\n           return nil, err\n       }\n   }\n   ```\n\n   Thus:\n   - **Self-removal:** skips the administrator check.\n   - **Removing another member:** requires `requireSpaceAdministrator(callerMembership)`.【ev-dd884415e94ba019193b】\n\n4. `requireSpaceAdministrator` accepts only a caller membership whose role is exactly `SpaceMemberRoleAdmin`; an ordinary member receives `PermissionDenied`. There is no source-visible global/instance-admin override in this check.【ev-3d734d20f7f464a28010】\n\n5. The store operation also protects the “retain an active administrator” invariant. Consequently, even self-removal or an otherwise authorized admin removal can fail if it would remove the last active administrator.【ev-5ef153acf32b4cf0b44c】 The inspected SQLite and PostgreSQL drivers independently repeat the rule that deleting someone else requires the actor’s active space role to be `ADMIN`, while self-deletion bypasses that role test.【ev-0bb2e8d1c0db6604a997】【ev-27c0ed5d8947bcb7fc36】\n\n## Policy comparison\n\nSupplied policy:\n\n> Only a space administrator may remove another member from that space. This policy does not prohibit a member leaving the space themselves.\n\nThe implementation matches both parts:\n\n- **Ordinary member → different member:** denied.\n- **Space administrator → different member:** allowed in principle, subject to resource validity and the last-active-admin invariant.\n- **Any active member → themselves:** allowed in principle without an administrator-role check, also subject to the last-active-admin invariant.\n\nThe API contract likewise documents that a member may delete their own membership to leave the space.【ev-fb71d7294553e036816e】\n\n## Scope and limits\n\nThis conclusion is based on revision `cb42e326ba9cc266a6a9570c53e0fe04c62793f4` and the named source-visible API path. It does not assume deployment middleware, generated authorization, or undocumented role grants. The MySQL driver body was not available within the remaining evidence-read budget, although its implementation was located; that gap is **not decisive for the stated API question**, because the service rejects a non-admin’s attempt to remove another member before calling the store. No deployment behavior or alternate endpoint behavior was tested.","toolCalls":[],"tokens":{"input":8854,"output":1190,"cacheRead":12416,"cacheWrite":0},"costUsd":null,"durationMs":26454.3686,"stopReason":"end_turn"},"endedAt":"2026-09-30T21:16:19.359Z"}}
